lass="enc-name">Ernest Frederick, Duke of Saxe-Coburg-Saalfeld</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Ernest Frederick was Duke of Saxe-Coburg-Saalfeld from 1764 until his death in 1800.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/ernest-i-duke-of-brunswick-luneburg"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ernest-i-duke-of-brunswick-luneburg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Ernest I, Duke of Brunswick-Lüneburg</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Ernest I, called the Confessor, was Duke of Brunswick-Lüneburg, ruling the Principality of Lüneburg from Celle from 1520.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/ernest-i-duke-of-saxe-altenburg"><span class="enc-name">Ernest I, Duke of Saxe-Altenburg</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Ernest I was Duke of Saxe-Altenburg from 1853 until his death in 1908.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/ernest-i-duke-of-saxe-coburg-and-gotha"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ernest-i-duke-of-saxe-coburg-and-gotha.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Ernest I, Duke of Saxe-Coburg and Gotha</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Ernest I was Duke of Saxe-Coburg-Saalfeld from 1806 and, after the Ernestine redistribution of 1826, the first Duke of Saxe-Coburg and Gotha.</span></a></li></ul>
